on County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. April to May came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, the most of any pair, and it is also the wettest pair at 9.64 inches normal. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 56% of normal in August to September and 42% in November to December. Grid 21164 had its driest year in 1963 at 62%.</p>"}
